  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent Catholic News</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase awareness of issues affecting the Church among believers and in the wider community.
Set up on a voluntary basis in May 2000 in response to Tertio Millennio Adveniente, which called for lay people to play a more active role in the work of the Church. Aim is to provide speedy and accurate news coverage of all subjects of interest to Catholics and the wider Christian community.</narrative>
  </description>
